<div class="page | stack">
    {% set crumbs = [{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "About", url: "/about/" }] %}
    {% set heroTitle = "About Pioneer PGD" %}
    {% set heroText = "Since 2019, Pioneer PGD has been Upper Hutt's certifying plumber, gasfitter and drainlayer, one local team across all three trades." %}
    {% set heroImage = "/img/pgd-footer.jpg" %}
    {% set heroAlt = "About Pioneer PGD, certifying plumber, gasfitter and drainlayer" %}
    {% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container | stack-large">
            <h2>The Local Story</h2>
            <div class="local-notes stack">
            <p>
                Since 2019, Pioneer Plumbing Gasfitting & Drainlaying Ltd has been
                providing reliable, professional services throughout Upper Hutt and
                the greater Wellington region. Plumbing is at the heart of our
                business, with a focus on installations, repairs, maintenance and
                practical problem solving for residential, rural and some commercial
                properties. From fixing leaks and replacing pipework to hot water
                systems and everyday plumbing issues, we take pride in quality
                workmanship and getting the job done properly.
            </p>
            <p>
                Drainlaying is our second area of expertise, with services ranging
                from soak pits, subsoil drainage and pump systems to rainwater
                harvesting, CCTV drain inspections and excavation, truck and digger
                work. We also provide certified gasfitting, including Rinnai Infinity
                gas hot water systems and general gasfitting services.
            </p>
            <p>
                We're proudly local to Upper Hutt, and when you choose Pioneer, you
                deal directly with the owner/operator on every job. Aidan is a
                Certified Plumber, Gasfitter and Drainlayer, bringing a friendly,
                reliable and hands-on approach to every project. Whether it's a
                straightforward plumbing repair or a larger drainage or gasfitting
                job, we provide practical solutions and quality workmanship you can
                rely on.
            </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container | stack-large">
            <h2>Certifying Licences</h2>
            <div class="local-notes">
                <div class="cert-layout">
                    <div class="cert-layout--text stack">
                        <p>
                            Aidan holds <strong>certifying plumber, certifying gasfitter
                            and certifying drainlayer</strong> licences, the highest level
                            issued by the Plumbers, Gasfitters and Drainlayers Board (PGDB).
                            That means every job, whether a repair or a new installations is carried out to code, and compliant.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We're also fully registered with the Board, you can verify our
                            licences at any time. It's the difference between a tradesman and
                            a certified professional, and it's non-negotiable for us. Search for Aidan Hullet by name on the <a href="https://www2.pgdb.co.nz/public-register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Public Register</a> to see for yourself.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    {% image "/src/img/pioneer-certifying-icons.png", "Certified Plumbing, Gasfitting and Drainlaying badges", [200, 400], "400px", "cert-layout--logo" %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section--container | stack-large">
            <h2>How We Work</h2>
            <div class="local-notes stack">
                <p><strong>Fixed Quotes:</strong> You know the price before work starts, no estimates, no surprises.</p>
                <p><strong>Site Visits:</strong> We can attend your site for job planning, fault finding and brainstorming solution options. Based on what we find and discuss with you we'll either carry out work on the day where appropriate or follow up with a detailed quote if its a more complex job.</p>
                <p><strong>Old Trade Ethics:</strong> All work big or small is compliant, thoughtful, tailored to suit and value for money.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-mbl">
        <div class="section--container | stack-large">
            <span class="section-label">Where We Excel</span>
            <div class="section--header | stack">
                <h2>Our Specialties</h2>
                <p class="section-intro">The jobs we get called for most, and the ones we know inside out.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="section--wrapper">
                <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
                    {% for s in services %}
                    {% if s.specialty %}
                    {% if s.type == "trade" %}
                        {% set sUrl = "/services/" ~ s.slug ~ "/" %}
                    {% else %}
                        {% set sUrl = "/services/" ~ s.trade | lower ~ "/" ~ s.slug ~ "/" %}
                    {% endif %}
                    <a href="{{ sUrl }}" class="home-card home-card--specialty">
                        <div class="home-card--img">
                            <img src="{{ s.specialty.image }}" alt="{{ s.specialty.imageAlt }}" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-card--body">
                            <div class="home-card--header">
                                <img class="home-card--icon" src="{{ s.icon }}" alt="{{ s.iconAlt }}" />
                                <h3>{{ s.specialty.heading | safe }}</h3>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

